 than VGG-16.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"test_009_s7","report_id":"test_009","text":"Figure 2 shows the training loss.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"test_009_s8","report_id":"test_009","text":"As shown in Figure 2, DistilBERT has a loss of 0.626 at epoch 70.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_009_s9","report_id":"test_009","text":"DistilBERT has a loss of 1.095 at epoch 50.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_009_s10","report_id":"test_009","text":"At epoch 20, the loss of Transformer is 1.115.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_009_s11","report_id":"test_009","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 30, the loss of ResNet-18 is 1.118.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_009_s12","report_id":"test_009","text":"Naive Bayes reaches 85.4% accuracy on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"test_009_s13","report_id":"test_009","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"}]}